| <code>execute_plan</code> | <code>plan_id:digest</code>, <code>operation_id:UUIDv7</code>, <code>confirmations:sorted unique string[0..64]</code>, <code>extensions</code> |

Presets are <code>minimal</code>, <code>overview</code>,
