+
+The metadata is traceable to specification Sections 1, 17, and 20 and
+Appendices A and D, with each generated family retaining its defining section
+and fixture-family references. Durable operation entries include their exact
+idempotency scope and recovery evidence. Capability entries are vocabulary
+members only: the public type has no availability, enabled, supported, or
+status field, so catalog generation cannot advertise runtime capability.
