+| Native `go build ./...` on darwin/arm64 | 0 | `go-build-darwin-arm64-final-02.log` |
+| Linux builds on amd64 and arm64 | 0 / 0 | `go-build-linux-amd64-final-02.log`; `go-build-linux-arm64-final-02.log` |
+| Windows builds on amd64 and arm64 | 0 / 0 | `go-build-windows-amd64-final-02.log`; `go-build-windows-arm64-final-02.log` |
+| `gofmt -l .` plus empty-output assertion | 0 / 0 | `gofmt-final-02.log` |
+| Strict JSON parse | 0 | `json-validation-final.log` |
+| `git diff --check` | 0 | `git-diff-check-final-02.log` |
+| `curator status --check` after installation repair | 0 | `curator-status-02.log` |
